  <data key="d9">0.94</data>
  <data key="d10">2.1.1 Features The DAA2 audio amplifiers have the following features: • 50W total output power at 25V RMS (all DAA2-5025 model versions) or 70 VRMS (all DAA2-5070 model versions).</data>
