  <data key="d10">6.1.4 FMM-4-20 4-20mA Monitor Module The FMM-4-20 is intended for use in intelligent, two-wire systems, allowing Control Panels to interface and monitor two-wire or three- wire sensors with a 4-20mA signal output.</data>
